      },
      "highlight": [
        {
          "kind": "quote",
          "text": "This system of lighting furnishes just the luminous half-gloom, the deeply significant chiaroscuro, that the painter requires in order to give the most poignant effect to his last and most thrilling conception of the world's tragedy.",
